.6,"_gate_margin_vs_hist":0.19418440612557306,"_gp_margin_vs_hist":false,"_score_margin_vs_hist":0.0,"_gate_piotroski":7,"_gp_piotroski":true,"_score_piotroski":77.8,"_gate_spread":-0.08940375550473287,"_gp_spread":false,"_score_spread":0.0,"_gate_roic_consistency":2.272066970192505,"_gp_roic_consistency":false,"_score_roic_consistency":0.0,"_gate_incr_roic":-0.03265045880340024,"_gp_incr_roic":false,"_score_incr_roic":5.8,"_gate_margin_advantage":-0.02101766880720038,"_gp_margin_advantage":false,"_score_margin_advantage":26.3,"_gate_pool_share":null,"_gp_pool_share":null,"_score_pool_share":null,"_gate_rev_durability":0.014833597555700573,"_gp_rev_durability":false,"_score_rev_durability":32.4,"_gate_fcf_durability":null,"_gp_fcf_durability":null,"_score_fcf_durability":0.0,"_gate_margins":0.020748522426247817,"_gp_margins":true,"_score_margins":70.7,"_gate_fund_growth":0,"_gp_fund_growth":false,"_score_fund_growth":0.0,"_gate_shrhldr_yield":0.0,"_gp_shrhldr_yield":false,"_score_shrhldr_yield":11.1,"_gate_share_shrink":0.15043971266008405,"_gp_share_shrink":false,"_score_share_shrink":0.0,"_gate_sbc_dilution":0.014104764523624304,"_gp_sbc_dilution":true,"_score_sbc_dilution":76.5,"_gate_insider_own":0.01567,"_gp_insider_own":false,"_score_insider_own":10.4,"_gate_insider_buying":0.0,"_gp_insider_buying":false,"_score_insider_buying":0.0,"pf":[],"description_full":"Innovex International, Inc. designs, manufactures, sells, and rents mission critical engineered products to the oil and natural gas industry worldwide. It provides drilling enhancement tools to optimize drilling performance, increase rate of penetration, and mitigate downhole challenges; and fishing and intervention which supports workover, intervention, drilling and completion activities, as well as manufactures and sells products including external catch tools, internal catch tools, and other related fishing and remedial tools. The company also offers well production solutions comprising products and services that enable artificial lift in wells and provides artificial lift accessory products and services, as well as wellhead penetrators, tubing hangers and adapters, ESP cable management, and spooling services; service, mileage, and others; subsea equipment and engineered systems for offshore applications, including subsea wellheads, subsea connectors, casing connectors, deepwater centralization solutions, and diverter systems; and surface wellhead systems. In addition, it provides well completion portfolio comprising products used to enable a well to be stimulated and put on production, such as liner hanger systems, toe initiation products, frac plugs, completion packers, casing flotation products, and related completion accessories; and well construction portfolio that consists of products designed to ensure the structural integrity of the wellbore. Further, the company offers products utilized to support effective cement placement between the wellbore and casing. It sells and rents its products to international and national oil companies, independent exploration and production companies, and multinational service companies. Its products have applications in the onshore and offshore oil and natural gas wells, including well construction, well completion, and well production and intervention. The company was founded in 2016 and is headquartered in Humble, Texas.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Adam B. Anderson | CEO & Director | Age 49 | Compensation: $1.1M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 2K people. Revenue per employee of $453K ranks in the bottom quartile among Energy peers. Stock-based compensation of $6K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 2\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags low compensation governance risk (2/10).","financial_summary":["Innovex International, Inc. is a small-cap energy business with a $1.8B market cap on $978M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +39% over the past three years and +1% annually across the full decade, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","Returns on capital run at 0% against a 9% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","Accruals are elevated at -8.5% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.","On the balance sheet, leverage is comfortably conservative at 0.1\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and interest coverage of 51\u00d7 is fortress-like.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom decile among Energy peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"red","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 7.7% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $612.9M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Cyclical sectors like Energy tend to underperform in slowdowns","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"The commodity cycle \u2014 revenue and free cash flow are ultimately hostage to a price the company does not set, and the long-run energy-transition arc adds a structural overhang.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Geopolitical supply shocks \u2014 wars, sanctions, and OPEC decisions create volatility that no hedging programme can fully neutralise.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Piotroski score 7/9 \u2014 financials improving across profitability, leverage and efficiency","Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Growing faster than most Energy peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool","Financial quality scores above most Energy peers","Energy sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 6% over 3 months","Energy ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Should Earnings And Guidance Reset Require Action From Innovex International (INVX) Investors?","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/energy/nyse-invx/innovex-international/news/should-earnings-and-guidance-reset-require-action-from-innov","date":"2026-11-07","timestamp":1794011433.76,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.572,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings","guidance"]},{"title":"Avoiding Lag: Real-Time Signals in (INVX) Movement","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/52/Avoiding_Lag:_Real-Time_Signals_in_INVX_Movement_110626065202_1793965922.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793965922.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.823,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Innovex International (INVX) Secures More Than $30 Million Indonesia Subsea Contract","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/energy/articles/innovex-international-invx-secures-more-151448370.html","date":"2026-10-31","timestamp":1793459688.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.94,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["product"]},{"title":"Innovex International (INVX) Stock Slides After Q3 Earnings Margin Gains","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/energy/nyse-invx/innovex-international/news/innovex-international-invx-stock-slides-after-q3-earnings-ma","date":"2026-10-3