th":["The balance sheet carries net cash of $186.6M (10% of market cap).","Short-term liquidity is ample (current ratio 4.91).","Its debt comes due soon (maturity wall about 1.4 years out), so refinancing terms matter.","Working capital ties up about 190 days of sales, a drag on cash generation."],"growth":["Revenue has compounded at 39.3% over 3 years, 21.8% over 5 years and 1.5% over 10 years, so growth is accelerating, and it has been lumpy (year-to-year swings of 24%).","Net reinvestment is nil (capex and working capital no more than cover depreciation), so fundamental growth is near zero.","Forward indicators: a book-to-bill of 0.92 (orders lagging sales), a backlog worth 10% of annual revenue and deferred revenue down 11%.","Capex roughly matches depreciation (1.1x, 7.7% of sales), a maintenance pace."],"own":["Insiders own a modest 1.6%, and reported institutional holdings exceed 100% of shares (a sign of heavy share lending).","Insiders have only sold over the past year (26 sales, net $612.9M sold).","The share count has grown 15.0% a year over five years, diluting existing holders."],"people":["With about 2,160 employees, each generates about $453K of revenue, 0.2x the Energy median, and productivity has risen 3.7% a year.","CEO pay is $1.1M (2x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (2/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $6K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"INSUFFICIENT DATA","conv":null,"head":"Not enough data to value it: missing price or fair value.","pros":[],"cons":[],"flags":[],"need":[],"buy_below":null,"vc":null,"med":{"pe":13.3952,"ev_ebitda":6.86,"pfcf":14.299,"pb":1.6885,"roic":0.0952,"gross_margin":0.2462,"fcf_margin":0.0754,"div_yield":0.0371}},"ticker":"INVX","date":"2026-11-06"}